+// Package f2pprobe contains the fail-to-pass (F2P) target probes for the
+// TypeScript-to-Go labeler migration. Each probe performs one concrete,
+// observable behavior declared by the frozen contract so that the behavior is
+// handled by the Go target technology and is absent under the TypeScript
+// source technology.
+package f2pprobe
